{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369200/extras/1574407acf35b4f37988c6d686054ea6.avif?t=1751389444\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to <i>KABUKI FIRE! </i></strong>Every year, during the peak of the rainy season, the world's best shooters gather on an zombie infested island, to participate in a lethal challenge. Armed with a set of pistols, participants are locked inside an abandoned village, to fight hordes of fiercely attacking creatures like Kabuki Dragons and Zombie Mosquitoes. One of the contestants is young yakuza Kamoku Shimazu. Driven by desire to revenge her beloved father's death, she enters the competition to win the trust of the crime lord, who once ordered the assassination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369200/extras/Comic_3.png?t=1751389444\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369200/extras/The_Gameplay.png?t=1751389444\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your reflexes and precision in this quirky hand-painted 2D shoot 'em up. The goal is to score points by shooting enemies and bonus objects within a time frame of 5 minutes. Climb up the high-score table and reach the rank of black belt (or maybe even one of the legendary red belts!). As the time counter progresses, your enemies are getting more aggressive and are furiously throwing dragon fire and zombie slime at you. Although you have unlimited ammo at your disposal, you are required to reload your gun regularly! Some enemies leave bonus objects in the arena after they vanish. These bonuses can be cached and stored in the inventory for strategic use or released immediately as they appear. The arsenal of bonuses include...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Chain Bomb</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Mighty Hammer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Ice Golem</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Razor Blades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Rockets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Plasma Storm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Distracting Doll</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and many more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369200/extras/Comic_1.png?t=1751389444\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369200/extras/The_Features.png?t=1751389444\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique hand-painted art-style</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Many bonus-objects</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 arena</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Approximately <strong>5 minutes playtime per game</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Martial arts style</strong> <strong>belt system</strong> (start as a white belt novice and reach the higher ranks!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Achievements and leaderboards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive atmosphere</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>High difficulty!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WARNING! KABUKI FIRE CONTAINS FLASHING LIGHTS THAT MAY POTENTIALLY TRIGGER SEIZURES IN PEOPLE WITH PHOTOSENSITIVE EPILEPSY. VIEWER DISCRETION IS ADVISED</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div cl